Sprint Definition of Done (DoD) Sequence
This sequence ensures each lead domino falls correctly before the next is touched, isolating risk at every step.

DoD 1: Schema Mutation

Define featuredProducts in homepageData.

Structure: Array -> Object -> product (reference type) + productPromo (string type).

Deploy/verify schema in Sanity Studio locally.

DoD 2: Payload Construction

Receive target data.

Format data into payload.json matching the exact object structure of featuredProducts.

DoD 3: Data Migration

Adapt the provided migration script template.

Execute script via PowerShell to patch homepageData with payload.json.

Verify data population in Sanity Studio (ensuring old featured data is untouched).

DoD 4: Frontend Integration

Receive frontend component code.

Update GROQ query/data fetching to target featuredProducts.

Update component mapping logic to render the new object shape (product data + promo text).

Verify UI rendering.